<http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#Asset> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The Class \"Asset\" is an object to which an identifier will be\n      associated at commissioning. It will serve as a central reference point to manage rights\n      associated to EditorialObjects, Resources, MediaResources or Essences, and PublicationEvents\n      (distribution and exploitation conditions)."@en .
