<http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#AudioTrack> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An audioTrack object defines a component of an audioStream.\r A\n      single set of samples or data in the storage medium."@en .
<http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#AudioTrack> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Represents a physical container or carrier to hold an audio stream.\n      This\r should be usually defined by many attributes such as ID, format (e.g. 48 kHz/24\r\n      bits), linkage information (e.g. odd/even)\u2026"@en .
<http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#AudioTrack> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An audioTrack is the basic audio data container of a medium.\n      Attribute is\r an unambiguous reference to this container in a given medium."@en .
