<http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#DataFormat> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "To provide addtional technical information on the characteristics of\n      data streams in a MediaResource including but not limited to AncillaryData, Subtilting and\n      Captioning. Additional specific data format may be defined as subclasses of\n      DataFormat."@en .
<http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#VideoTrack> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class> .
