<http://www.bbc.co.uk/ontologies/coreconcepts/Event> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<http://www.bbc.co.uk/ontologies/coreconcepts/Event> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Music events, historic events, sports events, politics events,\n      e.t.c."@en .
<http://www.bbc.co.uk/ontologies/coreconcepts/Event> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Event"@en .
<http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#EditorialObject> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class> .
<http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#EditorialObject> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#BusinessObject> .
<http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#EditorialObject> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "In the audiovisual domain, the Class EditorialObject transforms a\n      commissioned concept into an editorial definition of a MediaResource before fabrication (in\n      the Production Domain) and Distribution (in the Distribution Domain). An EditorialObject is a\n      set of descriptive metadata summarising e.g. editing decisions. An EditorialObject can also be\n      a part of an EditorialObject, which is defined by its start time and duration. An\n      EditorialObject can also be a group of EditorialObjects. For example a series composed of\n      episodes is defined as an EditorialObject."@en .
<http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#EditorialObject> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Editorial Object"@en .
<http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#Affiliation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class> .
<http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#Affiliation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Affiliation"@en .
<http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#Affiliation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#Organisation> .
<http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#Affiliation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "An Organisation to which a Contact is affiliated (with period of\n      validity)."@en .
<http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#Series> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class> .
<http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#Series> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#Group> .
<http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#Series> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Series is a particular type of collection. TV or Radio Series are\n      composed of Episodes."@en .
<http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#Series> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Series"@en .
<http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#AudioProgramme> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class> .
<http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#AudioProgramme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A set of one or more audioContent that derive from the same\n      material,\r i.e. an audioMultiplex, and the definition of its multiplexed audioContents\n      (e.g.\r foreground and commentary, background music)."@en .
<http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#AudioProgramme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#Programme> .
<http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#AudioProgramme> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Audio programme"@en .
<http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#Resource> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class> .
<http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#Resource> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#disjointWith> <http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#BusinessObject> .
<http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#Resource> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A manifestation of a BusinessObject."@en .
<http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#Resource> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Resource"@en .
<http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#Resource> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#Asset> .
<http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#Part> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class> .
<http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#Part> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#EditorialObject> .
<http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#Part> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Part, Fragment, Segment"@en .
<http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#Part> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A Fragment is a particular section of a MediaResource identified by\n      a start and end time or duration. Fragment can also be called segment or part."@en .
<http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#Part> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "One of more media fragment (audio, video, data) composing an\n      audiovisual media resource. In other ontolgies fragment is often referred to e.g. as a 'part'\n      or 'segment' or 'fragment'."@en .
<http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#PublicationChannel> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class> .
<http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#PublicationChannel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#Service> .
<http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#PublicationChannel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "The name of the channel through which a Resource has been published\n      as a PublicationEvent. A PublicationChannel can use a variety of medias e.g. broadcast or\n      online."@en .
<http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#PublicationChannel> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Publication Channel"@en .
<http://www.bbc.co.uk/ontologies/coreconcepts/Person> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class> .
<http://www.bbc.co.uk/ontologies/coreconcepts/Person> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Person"@en .
<http://www.bbc.co.uk/ontologies/coreconcepts/Person> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<http://www.bbc.co.uk/ontologies/coreconcepts/Person> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "all types of people such as politicians, athletes, historic figures,\n      contributors in programmes e.t.c."@en .
<http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#Signing> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class> .
<http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#Signing> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#VideoTrack> .
<http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#Signing> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Signing"@en .
<http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#Signing> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "To signal the presence of Signing for hard of hearing users. The\n      type of Signing (e.g. incursted in or else) or language of Signing can be specified using the\n      appropriate properties."@en .
<http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#PhysicalResource> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class> .
<http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#PhysicalResource> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#Resource> .
<http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#PhysicalResource> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Physical resource" .
<http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Agent> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class> .
<http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Agent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A person or Organisation."@en .
<http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Agent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Agent"@en .
<http://xmlns.com/foaf/0.1/Agent> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<http://www.bbc.co.uk/ontologies/coreconcepts/Organisation> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class> .
<http://www.bbc.co.uk/ontologies/coreconcepts/Organisation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Organisation"@en .
<http://www.bbc.co.uk/ontologies/coreconcepts/Organisation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "E.g., Businesses."@en .
<http://www.bbc.co.uk/ontologies/coreconcepts/Organisation> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#Season> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class> .
<http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#Season> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#Group> .
<http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#Season> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Season"@en .
<http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#Season> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A series can be composed of one or more seasons clustering a certain\n      number of episodes. Fro this reason, seasons are related to series using the isRelatedTo\n      property."@en .
<http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#Essence> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class> .
<http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#Essence> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Essence"@en .
<http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#Essence> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#MediaResource> .
<http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#Essence> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Essence is content ready for distribution. Essence can become a\n      MediaResource in further production processes."@en .
<http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#TimelineTrack> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class> .
<http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#TimelineTrack> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing> .
<http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#TimelineTrack> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "To define a time sequence of EditorialObjects."@en .
<http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#TimelineTrack> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Timeline track"@en .
<http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/date> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Property> .
<http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/date> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#range> <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#date> .
<http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/date> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A date associated with the BusinessObject, Resource or\n      Contact/Person."@en .
<http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/date> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "date"@en .
<http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#Episode> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#Class> .
<http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#Episode> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#subClassOf> <http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#EditorialObject> .
<http://www.ebu.ch/metadata/ontologies/ebucore/ebucore#Episode> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "Episode" .
